Course: AI Magic Academy — summon your star mecha beast and build a character gallery site;
Duration: 90 minutes;
For: children meeting AI creation for the first time;
Goals: understand text-to-image and text-to-video, and get a first look at the AI Vibe Coding environment;
Tools: Lingdong AI Canvas, Lingdong Vibe Coding client;
Outcome: 3 polished AI pet / mecha hero key visuals, a 15-second storyboard video, 2 free-creation images and an interactive character gallery site.

